  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earmarked Contribution to No Peace Without Justice project &quot;HRC40 Side-Event: Death Notifications in Syria&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raise awareness and foster discussion on the future of human rights, accountability and justice in Syria.

By focusing on the status of detainees, victims of enforced and arbitrary detention and their families and the long-terms effects on Syrian society, this event will provide a platform to discuss how enforced disappearances, indiscriminate arrests and torture can directly infringe the human rights of relatives of the deceased, including their housing, land, and property rights. In addition, the event opens up the important discussions on the way forward for Syrian families as well as Syrian society as a whole.</narrative>
  </description>
